---
/* Component — PageHeaderStart
 * The start region of the page's top bar.
 *
 * Claims grid column 1 of PageHeader's `1fr auto 1fr` track list explicitly
 * rather than relying on source order, so the region lands correctly whatever
 * subset of the three is present and whatever order they appear in.
 *
 * justify-content: start is flow-relative inside a flex container, so the
 * region's own content packs to the inline start and mirrors under RTL with no
 * physical left/right. */
---

<div>
  <slot />
</div>

<style>
  div {
    grid-column: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: start;
    gap: var(--bravoixr-spacing-3);
  }
</style>
